      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that people say things get better, but what if they don't? what if this feeling of being obsolete is just... the truth of my situation? there's a certain kind of peace in just accepting that some things were meant to have an end. like a sunset. you dont fight the sunset, you just let it happen. it feels more honest to just admit that i've reached my limit.",
